Hanoi. We use performing arts as a tool for human development, creativity, and connection.\r\n\r\nATH brings together artistic creation, education, and social engagement in one place, working with individuals, schools, and organizations.\r\n\r\n“Art is not a reflection of life, but a way of transforming it.” - Konstantin Stanislavski\r\n<h3>WHAT WE DO?</h3>\r\n<ul role=\"list\">\r\n 	<li>Artistic programs and live performances</li>\r\n 	<li>Educational and training programs</li>\r\n 	<li>Theatre-based projects for communities and organisations</li>\r\n</ul>'),(526,58,'_sections_2_description','field_au_description'),(527,58,'sections_2_image','107'),(528,58,'_sections_2_image','field_au_image'),(529,108,'sections','a:3:{i:0;s:11:\"hero-banner\";i:1;s:16:\"product-cat-grid\";i:2;s:8:\"about-us\";}'),(530,108,'_sections','field_66e06b671d530'),(531,108,'image',''),(532,108,'_image','field_hb_image'),(533,108,'title',''),(534,108,'_title','field_hb_title'),(535,108,'description',''),(536,108,'_description','field_hb_description'),(537,108,'button_text',''),(538,108,'_button_text','field_hb_button_text'),(539,108,'button_link',''),(540,108,'_button_link','field_hb_button_link'),(541,108,'sections_0_section_id','home__hero-banner'),(542,108,'_sections_0_section_id','field_hb_section_id'),(543,108,'sections_0_image','68'),(544,108,'_sections_0_image','field_hb_image'),(545,108,'sections_0_title','Education, performance and art.'),(546,108,'_sections_0_title','field_hb_title'),(547,108,'sections_0_description','Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since.'),(548,108,'_sections_0_description','field_hb_description'),(549,108,'sections_0_button_text','Contact us'),(550,108,'_sections_0_button_text','field_hb_button_text'),(551,108,'sections_0_button_link','http://localhost/2026/ath/'),(552,108,'_sections_0_button_link','field_hb_button_link'),(553,108,'sections_1_section_id',''